DUKAAN DOST AI

Your Smart AI-Powered Shop Assistant

Project Category: Voice AI | Retail Automation | AI Agent

1. Problem Statement

Small shopkeepers struggle to manage customer purchases, especially during busy hours. They often write transactions manually on paper, while larger shops depend on barcode scanners. When multiple customers arrive, recording purchases becomes slow, difficult and prone to human errors.

2. Proposed Solution

Dukaan Dost AI is an intelligent, voice-first shop management assistant that simplifies retail operations through two working modes.

Mode 1 – Rush Hour Mode (Voice AI)

When many customers arrive, shopkeepers can activate the voice agent and speak customer names, purchased products and quantities. The AI understands the instructions, extracts the details and automatically saves purchase records.

Mode 2 – Normal Mode (Barcode + Voice)

During regular business hours, shopkeepers can scan product barcodes or use voice commands to add products and quantities directly to the sales records.

3. Key Features

- Voice-based customer purchase recording.
